    "Scenarios are run VERBATIM from the Pulse container's own bundled library so the traces are",
    "Kitware's validated cases, not ones we authored. Column selection happens here instead, in",
    "the downsampler. `columns` maps the name we commit to the exact CSV header Pulse emits.",
    "`landmarks` name the times the oracle tests assert against, so a test reads as physiology",
